ursos.com.br%2Fnoticias%2Fimages%2Fcc81b82d-6dff-4a47-88f1-d4945043a006.webp&amp;w=1536&amp;q=75 1536w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fs3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fs3.blog.focusconcursos.com.br%2Fnoticias%2Fimages%2Fcc81b82d-6dff-4a47-88f1-d4945043a006.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fs3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fs3.blog.focusconcursos.com.br%2Fnoticias%2Fimages%2Fcc81b82d-6dff-4a47-88f1-d4945043a006.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fs3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fs3.blog.focusconcursos.com.br%2Fnoticias%2Fimages%2Fcc81b82d-6dff-4a47-88f1-d4945043a006.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fs3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fs3.blog.focusconcursos.com.br%2Fnoticias%2Fimages%2Fcc81b82d-6dff-4a47-88f1-d4945043a006.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-1.5 md:gap-2"><h3 class="font-bold text-foreground transition-colors group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-3 text-base md:text-xl">SEDUC PA: edital publicado com 2 mil vagas para a educação</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2 hidden text-sm sm:block">A seleção será organizada pela Fundação Getulio Vargas (FGV) e contempla oportunidades para professores, especialistas em educação e profissionais das áreas administrativa, de gestão e suporte educacional.</p><span class="text-muted-foreground/70 text-xs">31 de ago de 2026</span></div></a><a href="https://noticias.focusconcursos.com.br/noticias/concursos-da-seguranca-pe-avancam-comissoes-sao-formadas-para-3905-vagas" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group flex border-b border-border gap-4 py-5 md:gap-6"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-muted shrink-0 rounded-sm h-[92px] w-[140px] md:h-[130px] md:w-[200px]"><img alt="Concursos da Segurança PE avançam: comissões são formadas para 3.905 vagas" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105" style="pos